(text "J7 board wire landing -> J2 off-board IDC cable, pin-for-pin.\n1/2=-12, 3..8=GND, 9/10=+12, 11/12=+5; 13..16 NC.\nNever connect another active PSU. Continuity-test red stripe / orientation before use." (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left)) (uuid "0db11a8a-9ea4-5bb1-bca9-de807a4f64ae"))
