(text "Wire landing and IDC are the SAME twelve connected power conductors.\nNamed continuations retain pin numbers and avoid drawing wires through symbol bodies.\nPins13..16 intentionally not connected. Harness is hand assembled, not JLC placement." (at 25.4 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "734ec4f4-3dc0-5b3c-a332-7502b298a230"))
